WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
Noah asks June Salon if they
can take him on Sunday.

2
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.260
Rosalia drafts a reply for June.

3
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:07.940
It does not sound like her.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.160
June says that is not how she talks.

5
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.900
Rosalia rewrites it, and June says yes.

6
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.600
That reply goes up under Noah's comment.
